{"vid":"MAUES5wAroI","source":"MAUES5wAroI.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":3.4,"txt":"You're learning with nine to five English. Business English for the"},{"t":8.5,"txt":"workplace."},{"t":15.4,"txt":"Hi Tim here with another nine to five english lesson"},{"t":21.8,"txt":"In today's lesson we're going to learn how to end a phone call in english."},{"t":29.8,"txt":"last time we looked at lots of useful expressions"},{"t":34.3,"txt":"for answering the phone and starting a call"},{"t":38.5,"txt":"but what about ending a call? if you finished your conversation what"},{"t":45.2,"txt":"can you say to end the call politely"},{"t":49.9,"txt":"well for starters one thing you want to avoid is just suddenly saying"},{"t":57.5,"txt":"goodbye to end a business call professionally there are three simple"},{"t":64.5,"txt":"steps to follow first you signal"},{"t":68.6,"txt":"that you want to end secondly you review your action points"},{"t":75.2,"txt":"and finally you say goodbye now signaling that you want to end a"},{"t":82.6,"txt":"call often starts with a word like well"},{"t":88.1,"txt":"so or okay these words show that you want to change"},{"t":95.8,"txt":"the subject then you can thank the person"},{"t":99.8,"txt":"and say you need to go or make a general comment let's"},{"t":106.2,"txt":"practice some of these ways of showing that you want to end a call listen"},{"t":112.6,"txt":"to each example then repeat it for yourself ready let's get started"},{"t":122.8,"txt":"well i should probably get going"},{"t":131,"txt":"it's been great to chat"},{"t":138.3,"txt":"so thanks for all the information"},{"t":146.7,"txt":"okay i've got to run here"},{"t":154.3,"txt":"as you can hear these types of comments signal an end to the conversation"},{"t":161.7,"txt":"you might have noticed two different expressions"},{"t":165.6,"txt":"that mean you have to leave a situation first was i should probably get"},{"t":173,"txt":"going and the second was i've got to run these are just"},{"t":179.6,"txt":"friendly ways of saying i need to leave. now a business call is like a little"},{"t":188.4,"txt":"meeting so the second step in ending a call"},{"t":193.8,"txt":"is reviewing the actions you've discussed often"},{"t":199,"txt":"this means stating what you will do next like i'll send you the file tomorrow"},{"t":206.3,"txt":"and if you want to confirm what the other"},{"t":209.4,"txt":"person will do or what you'll both do you can turn your statement into a"},{"t":216.3,"txt":"question using a tag that might sound like"},{"t":221.8,"txt":"so you'll review the proposal next week right let's try some"},{"t":228.4,"txt":"other examples of reviewing next steps remember to repeat the examples"},{"t":235.8,"txt":"after you hear them"},{"t":239.5,"txt":"so i'll send you that file tomorrow and you can let me know what you think"},{"t":250.1,"txt":"all right so we'll be chatting again next week right"},{"t":259.5,"txt":"i'll have that package sent off right away"},{"t":267.4,"txt":"i'll look out for your email later today"},{"t":276.2,"txt":"one expression you might have noticed there"},{"t":279.8,"txt":"is isle or i will have that package sent off for example"},{"t":287.6,"txt":"what does it mean to have something done it means you make sure the thing"},{"t":295.5,"txt":"is done it might be you it might be someone else but you will"},{"t":302.1,"txt":"make sure it's done all right"},{"t":307.2,"txt":"so you've signaled that you want to end the call"},{"t":311,"txt":"and you've reviewed next steps now you're ready to sign off"},{"t":317.8,"txt":"or say goodbye there are many ways to say goodbye"},{"t":322.9,"txt":"in english you can wish someone a great day or a"},{"t":329.5,"txt":"good weekend or good luck with something and we often say"},{"t":336.7,"txt":"take care or mention when we'll talk again"},{"t":341.8,"txt":"let's practice some more ways to sign off"},{"t":345.2,"txt":"at the end of a call once again repeat the examples after you hear them"},{"t":353.4,"txt":"have a great day bye now"},{"t":361.2,"txt":"take care amy we'll talk again soon"},{"t":369.2,"txt":"all right then have a good weekend"},{"t":377.2,"txt":"good luck with your presentation"},{"t":386.2,"txt":"did you hear that expression by now you might also hear people say bye for"},{"t":393.7,"txt":"now or maybe by then"},{"t":398.2,"txt":"these are just common and friendly ways of saying goodbye so"},{"t":405.3,"txt":"we've practiced some useful expressions but how do these sound in a conversation"},{"t":412.8,"txt":"let's listen to a short dialogue between mark"},{"t":416.9,"txt":"and leslie both people are signaling they want to end the conversation"},{"t":423.8,"txt":"and using expressions to sign off let's listen"},{"t":431.1,"txt":"well i hope your interview goes well thanks kevin it's been great to chat for"},{"t":437.6,"txt":"sure glad we could catch up all right then"},{"t":440.9,"txt":"have a good weekend"},{"t":444.6,"txt":"how did that sound leslie thanks kevin for saying he hopes her interview"},{"t":451,"txt":"goes well then she makes a comment about their"},{"t":455.3,"txt":"conversation mark responds with his own comment and"},{"t":460.2,"txt":"leslie signs off by wishing him a good weekend now"},{"t":467,"txt":"it's your turn to practice we'll repeat the dialogue"},{"t":471.7,"txt":"but this time we're going to beep out the second speaker's words"},{"t":477.4,"txt":"you will have to say those parts yourself"},{"t":481.2,"txt":"remember to thank kevin and say it's been great to chat then"},{"t":488.4,"txt":"you'll wish him a good weekend after using the expression all right"},{"t":495,"txt":"then"},{"t":498.5,"txt":"well i hope your interview goes well"},{"t":507.9,"txt":"for sure glad we could catch up"},{"t":518.4,"txt":"well that's all for this lesson we've learned a three-step process to"},{"t":525.2,"txt":"ending a business call this includes signaling you want to end the call"},{"t":532.7,"txt":"reviewing the steps and saying goodbye 